dated_at":"2026-03-02T20:18:51+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164042469,"discussion_id":"6eccf1c5b917c2140dd690a30c6e80c4ebd826f6","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR重构了`aclnnArgMax`和`aclnnArgMin`算子中用于获取NPU架构支持数据类型的`GetSupportDtypeList`函数。原实现通过静态`std::map`进行映射查找，代码较为复杂。重构旨在提升代码的可读性和可维护性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n重构方案将`GetSupportDtypeList`函数的实现从依赖`std::map`查找，改为使用预定义的静态数据类型列表和直接的条件判断逻辑。根据不同的NPU架构（如`DAV_2002`、`DAV_1001`等）直接返回对应的支持列表，消除了对`std::map`的依赖，使代码结构更简洁、逻辑更清晰。","created_at":"2026-03-02T20:19:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-02T20:19:13+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164042574,"discussion_id":"343178b5ecf3767f007b21fa49f012bc966713d0","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-02T20:19:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-02T20:19:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164044333,"discussion_id":"8a47f31728f61ee5ad7bb73a5e6889eadfc4ce24","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-02T20:31:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-02T20:31:29+08:00","user":{"id":"68c27eb637720e1c67469af4","login":"xuf